    # https://valheim.weirdgloop.org/w/Captive_Fuling ; https://valheim.weirdgloop.org/w/Mörkhalla ; game files 1.0 (read with the repo's UnityPy reader, 2026-09-28) (Spawner_GoblinDeepNorth in morkhalla_floor* rooms)
