    # https://valheim.weirdgloop.org/w/Geirrhafa ; https://valheim.weirdgloop.org/w/Hildir ; game files 1.0 (read with the repo's UnityPy reader, 2026-09-28) (Spawner_Cultist_Hildir_bossroom; event hildirboss2 spawns Fenring_Cultist_Hildir_nochest)
