    # https://valheim.weirdgloop.org/w/Mistile ; https://valheim.weirdgloop.org/w/Dvergr_Mage ; game files 1.0 (read with the repo's UnityPy reader, 2026-09-28) (SpawnAbility DvergerMistile_spawn; no CharacterDrop)
